 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Accounts get ids 0,1,2,... in creation order. addAccount(credit) creates an account whose total credit starts at credit. addAccountWithReferral(credit, referrerId) does the same and also adds credit to the total of its direct referrer only (no further ancestors). getTotalCredit(accountId) returns that total. Inference narrows the preview's double credit to a non-negative integer (0..10^6) so both languages are exact; referrerId and accountId always name existing accounts.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
